WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
We originally had a schedule today, too.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.200
So the guys and I got annoyed.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.800
'Are you kidding? Let us rest
the day after the concert!'

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.300
That's what we said.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.600
'Come on, use some common sense!'

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.950
So today was a day off.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.100
Everyone was so cool this time,

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.600
and so good. I really respect them.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.100
But I fell for Yejun all over again.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.250
[Yejun sings]

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:27.850
He sings so well.

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:31.200
When I first saw Yejun
practicing at rehearsal,

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.200
afterward, I said to him,

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.400
'What the hell? You're just going
to steal the whole show!'

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.200
'Why are you so sexy?'

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.650
The others were all,
'Hyung, isn't that a bit much?'

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.600
'How are you that good?'

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.250
I had a moment of regret.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.600
I should've picked a slow song
and gone for that moody vibe.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.100
Why did I choose to dance?
I really kept thinking that.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:58.800
At that point, I'd already finished
planning and structuring my stage.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:02.700
But the camera movements and all that
hadn't been finalized yet.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.700
I finalized it on the 12th.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.700
So I went upstairs and said,

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:11.700
'I'm sorry. I've only just finalized
all my blocking and everything.'

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.700
'Could we go over the camera work
one more time?'

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:18.300
One of the DDUKS—our production staff—
had to stay late because of me.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.450
I felt so bad.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:22.250
'I'm so sorry. Because of me...'

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.300
'Sorry I made you work overtime.'

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.900
'No, it's really fine.
I was going to leave late anyway.'

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:30.350
'As long as the stage turns out well,
I don't mind.'

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:34.700
I was so grateful, I bowed down to my knees
and kept apologizing.

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:37.300
In the end, it turned out great.

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:40.100
Yesterday, the director said to me,

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.200
he had to memorize the camera cues,
but I kept changing them.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.900
I hadn't even given him time to learn them.
He was so nervous.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:49.800
I was scrambling to change everything
the day before,

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:53.200
but still got a good result,
and that was what made me so annoying!

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.300
So I felt really relieved.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.700
And our PLLI said
they really loved the stage, too.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:03.300
I kept thinking, 'What a relief.'

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.100
I was so nervous about the concert.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.600
The others kept practicing
until they could do it in their sleep.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.900
Bamby and I had practiced a bit less.
So we were both like,

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:15.250
'Why are you all working so hard?
You're making us look bad!'

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.900
'Why is Nam Yejun so sexy?'

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:20.600
'Why is Do Eunho practicing so hard?'

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:22.800
'What's with Yu Hamin, seriously?'

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.000
I said to Bamby,
'What are we going to do?'

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.650
'Hyung, we're in real trouble.'

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:29.100
'At least you've got
your camera work figured out.'

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.900
'But I still haven't
gotten it into my body yet.'

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.450
'What do we do?'

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.150
'What else? We practice, hyung.'

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.800
Then I went home.

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:39.100
But Bamby stayed behind
and kept practicing on his own!

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:42.100
At rehearsal the next day,
Bamby was so good.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:45.450
I was like, 'Chae Bamby,
what do you think you're doing?'

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.500
'What?'

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.800
'I practiced what we talked about
practicing yesterday.'

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.450
'But I didn't!'

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.200
'Hyung, you have to practice!'

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:57.000
'We're supposed to do it together!
Why did you get ahead on your own?'

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.400
'Oh, I'm sorry.'

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.000
He actually apologized!
'Sorry, I'm sorry.'

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.900
'You think sorry fixes everything?'

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.650
'No more practicing from today!'

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.400
I told him not to practice!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.200
Are there other artists
who tell you everything this honestly?

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.650
I don't know.

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:17.700
I just want to tell you everything.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:20.900
But we couldn't help it this time.
There was just so much to do.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.400
Getting the choreography in sync
was really hard this time.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:26.400
Here's what gets me about Bamby:
he makes the choreography,

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.200
then doesn't remember
the choreography he made!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.100
He asks us. He asks Hamin,
'What was it again?'

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:36.500
Hamin's absolutely beside himself.
'Why are you like this? Seriously, why?'

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.500
'Hyung, YOU made it!'
'But what was it again?'

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.950
'I can't remember.'
Then Bamby laughs to himself.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.800
Hamin goes,
'What's wrong with him, seriously?'

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.950
Hamin's overwhelmed too,
so at some point he just lets it slide.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:51.200
The more we went on, the more I thought
we shouldn't practice like this.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.700
'Guys, let's start again
from the beginning.'

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:57.100
Everyone must've felt it too.
'Okay! Let's do it right away.'

00:03:57.100 --> 00:04:00.250
That's how we got it in sync.
But here's the annoying part.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:02.200
'Okay, let's try through verse one.'

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:04.350
We finished,
and Bamby started clapping.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.600
'Wow, it's completely different!'

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.250
'So clean! Amazing! I love it!'

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.600
'Wow, it really IS different!'

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:15.000
Hamin and I just put our heads
in our hands and sighed. 'So annoying!'

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.600
But he's so harmless and innocent.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:20.100
You can't even scold him. He's cute!

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.500
'Got it?'

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.600
'Charm your way out of this one.'

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:28.850
What's really annoying is,
everyone has things they need to fix.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.000
Hamin points out what I get wrong.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.700
'Okay, okay. Sorry, sorry, sorry.'
'I got mixed up.'

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:37.100
When Hamin does that, I get annoyed.
'Yu Hamin, just you wait...'

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:40.300
'I'll catch you out!'
But it's hard to catch him.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.650
He's never made a mistake
when we're filming choreography.

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:46.400
But this time, for the first time,
we were doing Born Savage.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:49.650
At the very end, we'd agreed
to all face forward.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:52.850
Hamin had suggested that before.
But this time, his move was wrong.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:55.850
'Huh? Let's try that part again.'
I watched,

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.000
and Hamin really was out of sync!

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.450
'Hey, you're not in sync!'

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.750
'Hyung, I'm moving
from here to here,

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.300
so I can't face forward.'

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.300
'Only sideways.'

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.450
'But YOU said we should face forward!'

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.920
'I physically can't do it.'

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.000
[In clip] Defying inertia!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.550
'Then why did you suggest that?'

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.000
'Hang on, let me try.
You can do it like this.'

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.350
'Oh, I can do it that way.'

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:18.300
'Then you should!
Are you kidding me?'

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:23.000
'Yu Hamin, you're not in sync!
You're the only one!'

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:27.800
I thought, 'Got you!'
I just kept teasing him about it.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.250
'What are you doing?'

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.700
'Okay! I'll fix it!'

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.450
'How could YOU do this?'

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.600
[Hamin] You're so annoying!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.150
[Hamin] He catches me out once
and won't let it go!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.500
Yes! Yes!

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:45.000
I finally caught him out!
That one thing!

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.850
Seriously...

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:51.250
It's so much fun!
Not that I hold a grudge.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:55.500
But Yu Hamin's always telling me,
'Hyung, I told you this yesterday.'

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.100
'Why are you doing it like that?'

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:01.550
I know it too, but when he points out
every single thing, it's annoying!

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:04.300
'Just you wait!'
We're constantly watching each other.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.900
[Noah] Yu Hamin is watching me.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.500
[Hamin] For some reason,
you're the only one I notice, hyung.
